  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:102px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Lothar-of-the-mound-people.jpg\" title=\"Lothar of the Mound People\"><img alt=\"Lothar of the Mound People\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"212\" src=\"/images/Lothar-of-the-mound-people.jpg\" width=\"100\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Lothar-of-the-mound-people.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Lothar of the Mound People</div></div></div>\n<p>Lothar of the Mound People teaches <a href=\"/wiki/Fighter_Skills\" title=\"Fighter Skills\">fighter skills</a> and can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a> near the <a href=\"/wiki/Obelisk\" title=\"Obelisk\">Obelisk</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Lothar.27s_Quotes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Lothar's Quotes </span></h2>\n<p><i>\"If you see the spirit of my dead Father, tell him... I'm sorry about the poison.\"</i>\n</p><p><i>\"If you go to the cave... be sure to wear a sweater.\"</i>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
